{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18103","headline":"感春三首 三 · 韩愈","name":"感春三首 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"晨游百花林，朱朱兼白白。\n柳枝弱而细，悬树垂百尺。\n左右同来人，金紫贵显剧。\n娇童爲我歌，哀响跨筝笛。\n艳姬蹋筵舞，清眸刺劒戟。\n心怀平生友，莫一在燕席。\n死者长眇芒，生者困乖隔。\n少年真可喜，老大百无益。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩愈","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18103.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18103","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}